{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_06_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-6","storyName":"回声飘荡的大厅","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"祥子回到家中，发现原本酗酒的父亲居然正在家里热情地准备饭菜。更让她没有想到的是，在这个梦里，自己的母亲没有去世。时隔多年，祥子再次见到了自己的“母亲”。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_06","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":11,"next":13,"characters":["激动的孩子们","贝娜","激动的孩子A","激动的孩子B","丰川祥子","和善的镇民","红豆","红豆&和善的镇民","？？？","“父亲”","“母亲”"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"charslot","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的孩子们","text":"爱丽丝姐姐，还有贝娜姐姐——！","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"我有遵守约定给你们带糖果哦，人人有份！","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的孩子们","text":"好耶——","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"那你们有按照约定，想好自己心里重要的东西吗？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7f/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的孩子A","text":"我的是存钱罐！你听，里面都是攒下来的硬币！","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的孩子B","text":"这是我前段时间种出的小花……很好看，所以想让贝娜姐姐帮忙保存。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_369_bena_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"好好好，大家排好队——一个个来！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_369_bena_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"爱丽丝和贝娜尝试让孩子们有序地介绍他们心中的珍视之物，但似乎每个孩子身上都散发着无限的热情。","id":25},{"type":"text","text":"稚嫩的童声此起彼伏，眼下的光景却丝毫不见混乱，反而充满了温馨。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"这不是祥子吗？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"你怎么突然回来啦？","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你是……？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我们最近正好在这有外勤任务，我就带祥子一起过来了，顺便让她回家看看。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_290_vigna_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"你爸爸每天都在念叨你呢，说你在一家大公司实习，忙得都不回信了。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"我就没见过他这么多话的时候，看来是真想你了！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"和善的镇民","text":"你快回去吧。给他一个惊喜，然后好好安慰一下他！","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_avg_npc_243.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"（小声）祥子，你从刚才就很奇怪……感觉反应老是慢半拍！","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a9/Avg_avg_290_vigna_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"请问……我家往哪走？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_290_vigna_1#11$1","focus":"all","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_243","focus":"all","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆&和善的镇民","text":"……？","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"charslot","id":57},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_bg_34_g1_victoriavillage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"虽然之后的对话异常尴尬，但祥子还是按好心人的指引，顺利地找到了回家的路。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"顺着蜿蜒的小路，她终于走到了自己“家”门前。那是一栋洁白的、陌生的房子。","id":63},{"type":"text","text":"庭院里的花草被修剪得整整齐齐，她能听见花坛里设备浇水的细微声响。屋顶的烟囱冒出一缕缕炊烟，屋子的主人正在准备今日的午餐。","id":64},{"type":"text","text":"可她知道，即将前往的，并不是她真正的“家”。","id":65},{"type":"text","text":"她真正的家，在遥远而不可及之处。","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"提到家，祥子会先想起丰川家的宅邸，然后是那个有着一股酒气、飘散着灰尘的小小的出租屋。","id":67},{"type":"text","text":"她想起了那个曾经诚实勤奋的父亲。","id":68},{"type":"text","text":"可惜真正的父亲，现在或许正提着酒瓶，游走在街头。也许他会提到自己的名字，可搭配的修饰词绝无可能与“美好”有关。","id":69},{"type":"text","text":"没错，这才是丰川祥子的现实。","id":70},{"type":"text","text":"而眼前的这些，是莫菲丝为她创造的梦境，也是用来囚禁她的牢笼。","id":71},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"charslot","id":75},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_65_g5_sakikodininghall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":76},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":79},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"character","id":81},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"一股食物的香气扑鼻而来。","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪哼哼——♪哼哼哼——♪","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"……祥子？！","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"你怎么突然回来了，不是说在公司工作很忙吗？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯……正好有外派任务，所以回来看看。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"你也不常寄信回来，我每天只能拿你以前的信翻来覆去地看。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"普通的信而已，倒也没有必要……","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"宝贝女儿寄回来的信，怎么可能普通呢！","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"父亲，好像有什么东西烧煳了……","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"——！","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"稍等我一下！","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":107},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_meatbakingtray","volume":"1","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":111},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_makesoup","volume":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":113},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_soup","volume":"1","id":114},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#3$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"忘记注意时间了……这下得重新做了……","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"为了能做出祥子喜欢的料理，我专门去学习了好一阵子，你不想尝尝吗？","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"父亲，你以前好像从不做饭？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"现在日子过得悠闲了，没事就喜欢捣鼓点新玩意。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"而且你的脸都瘦成这样了……","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"罗德岛有定期体检——我体重还是和以前一样，没有变化。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"肯定瘦了！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"“父亲”心疼地伸出了手，摸了摸女儿的头。","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——！","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"嗯……？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"父亲的手让她感到既陌生又熟悉。","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"记忆里她总是弯下腰，将烂醉的父亲的手臂搭在自己肩上，然后半步半步地往家的方向走去。","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"他的手总是无力地垂在她眼前，就像刚才那样近在咫尺，可又那么不同……","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"又不是小孩子了，不要这样了……","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"对我来说，祥子永远都是我可爱的女儿。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"即使出去工作了，也不能忘记保持笑容啊~","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……嗯。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"父女两人面对面地笑了起来，刚才的犹豫也全被祥子抛在了脑后。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"她能确信，自己现在正发自内心地笑着。","id":155},{"type":"dialog","id":156},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smoothpiano","volume":"0.2","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"楼上为什么会有钢琴声……今天家里有客人吗？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"嗯？你在说什么呀，祥子？","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"肯定是瑞穗在琴房练琴呀。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……妈妈？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"是啊，那架钢琴不是从来都只有你和瑞穗能弹吗？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"对哦，祥子回来了，还没告诉瑞穗呢。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“父亲”","text":"她要是看见你，肯定要高兴坏了，你赶紧上去吧！","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_65_g5_sakikodininghall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.7","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"双腿发软。","id":182},{"type":"text","text":"脑中持续不断地嗡鸣。","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","volume":"1","id":185},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piano_start","volume":"0.1","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"钢琴。","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"在钢琴声中，关于妈妈的记忆慢慢涌上心头。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"祥子记得，举行妈妈的葬礼那天，她哭得很伤心。","id":190},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","volume":"1","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smoothpiano","volume":"0.3","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"妈妈最爱的乐器就是钢琴，所以祥子也喜欢钢琴。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"她会轻轻地握住祥子的手，教她摸索钢琴上的每一个黑白键。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"在妈妈离开后的日子里，祥子依然清晰地记得两人相处时的每一个细节，并常常一遍接一遍地弹奏妈妈教给她的每首曲子。","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenstairfts","volume":"1","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"逃吧。","id":201},{"type":"text","text":"一切都是虚假的，一切都不过是莫菲丝创造的梦境。","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"她不是真正的妈妈。","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"莫菲丝怎么可能了解她的一切？","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"她是低劣的伪造品。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"可是。","id":206},{"type":"text","text":"可是——","id":207},{"type":"text","text":"脚步根本没有停下的意思，甚至越来越快。","id":208},{"type":"text","text":"即使这是梦境，即使她是“伪造品”。","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_65_i09.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.5","id":216,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"她就这样，真实地出现在了眼前。","id":218},{"type":"text","text":"她就坐在那，沉醉在自己的演奏中。","id":219},{"type":"text","text":"窗外的光线打在她的身上，让她的身影有些难以分辨。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"可此时此刻，祥子心中只有一个想法——","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"妈……妈妈……？","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"“母亲”停下了演奏，她转过了身。","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“母亲”","text":"……祥子？","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的一切，是那么地真切。","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"background","id":230},{"type":"image","id":231},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":234},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>一生飞翔的羽兽，并非不愿降落于陆地。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":235},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>坚韧的双翼，掩饰的是无足的苦痛与悲剧。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":236},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>我，毋畏遗忘。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":237},{"type":"subtitle","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":242},{"type":"charslot","id":243},{"type":"image","id":244}],"characters":["激动的孩子们","贝娜","激动的孩子A","激动的孩子B","丰川祥子","和善的镇民","红豆","红豆&和善的镇民","？？？","“父亲”","“母亲”"]}